            "review_title": "Review at Pineapple Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Thomas M\nSparta, New Jersey42 contributions\n0\nPineapple Restaurant and Sky\nNov 2020\nPineapple Restaurant and Sky Lounge\n\nRecently had dinner at the Pineapple Restaurant and Sky Lounge. As a restaurant owner and manager, I was pleasantly surprised from the moment I entered the property. The view and attention to detail was incredible. And the service was befitting a Michelin rated restaurant. I ordered the Australian Wagyu tenderloin, medium-rare and was disappointed when it was served medium. Jane, our server, insisted on returning it to the kitchen. And within minutes she returned with a steak that met my requirements. Shortly afterward, Chef Jordi introduced himself to inquire if we were satisfied with our meal. Needless to say, every aspect of our dinner was superb. If you ever desire a restaurant with incredible food, a compelling view, and attentive service, the Pineapple Restaurant is the best in the area. And kudos to Jane, our server, for her professional demeanor and understanding of the importance of customer service. Jane is a positive asset to the restaurant and made our experience memorable.\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2020",
