            "review_title": "Review at Pineapple Restaurant",
            "review_text": "kathi K\nSde Boker, Israel27 contributions\n0\nvery disappointing\nFeb 2020\nVery disappointing. We ordered a vegetable dish and a tofu dish. The tofu was fine, but the serving was very small. The other dish was supposed to have celery and mushrooms but didn't. We told the waitress and she came back 10 minutes later with the same dish plus chunks of raw onions. Once again we told her that this wasn't what we ordered. By the time all our food arrived, half was cold. They didn't even offer any compensation. Definitely don't recommend.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 25, 2020",
