            "review_title": "Review at Pineapple Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Claudia Z\n17 contributions\n0\nAttentive staff, nice presentation and tasty chicken curry without tomatoes\nMay 2019 • Family\nWe escaped a tourist trap where our tour damped us before taking the train for Hanoi. We arrived to Pinapple by chance and the staff was friendly. They served juices in very nice glasses. When food arrived, my dad discovered tomatoes in his curry and he is allergic to it. The owner proposed to recook the food and they prepared a delicious curry without tomatoes. My prawns were also very fresh!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 17, 2019",
