            "review_title": "Review at Pineapple Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kelly B\nLos Angeles, California21 contributions\n0\nDecent foreign food\nApr 2019 • Family\nMy brother, sister, and I ate here while waiting for the train. Thankfully my sister was able to satisfy her pizza craving at this place but the pizza (and the curry I ordered) were very average. I would suggest ordering more of the local dishes since they might be better, maybe? We had two cocktails and they also were average. Not bad, but not great. They do have Wi-Fi which was a plus! This is not a bad place to spend an hour or two while waiting for the train, but don’t expect amazing food if you order non-Vietnamese dishes!\nRead more\nWritten May 2, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
