            "review_title": "Review at Pineapple Restaurant",
            "review_text": "LargelyMonk\nBanstead, United Kingdom1758 contributions\n1\nGood place to wait for Hanoi train\nMar 2019 • Couples\nWe had spent a few days in Sapa and our minibus train dropped us here on the way back. We had a couple of hours to kill and along with several others in the same position, needed somewhere to stay until the train was ready. The staff here were lovely and we sat in a booth eating spring rolls and drinking beers whilst we waited. They speak good English, are very relaxed about groups of people with bags and there is a chap outside who cleans shoes which we used as we had been trekking and our shoes were filthy.\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2019\n111pineapple\nThank you for your satisfaction with our service. We will try harder to bring comfort to our customers. Best service for all.❤\nWritten March 20, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
