            "review_title": "Review at Pineapple Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jesper\n3 contributions\n1\nThe waiter sneezed in my food.\nMar 2018 • Friends\nI have had a great week trekking sapa and experienced great food and local culture. We were told by our guide that kilroy was sponsoring the restaurant and we followed like chickens. \nFirst and foremost we were 11 people joined at dinner, the first meal got served 1hr before the last and Therefore everyone was done before many of the guys got their food. \nI ordered a chief burger and When he was about to serve it, he sneezed in my food and didnt Care the least. The place is horrible and the worst thing i have ever tried in my life. The rest of the group experienced alike; they even managed to ruin a simple pasta pesto. Any Street kitchen would top this restaurant. I RECOMMEND NO ONE TO GO HERE.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2018",
